# Metallic PBR material: high metallic, fairly smooth (low roughness) so
# the specular highlight is small, sharp, and tinted by the albedo texture
# instead of white — the visible signature of a real metal vs. a dielectric.
newmtl metal
Kd 1.000 1.000 1.000
map_Kd ../textures/metal.tga
Pr 0.25
Pm 1.0
